OL,3,GNEWSA'Alarm' as asylum seeker unit
OL,4,Aconfirmed for village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Labour government has confirmed it
OL,7,Fis pressing ahead with plans to house
OL,8,Fasylum seekers in an empty building in
OL,9,Fa village in Cambridgeshire, despite
OL,10,Fobjections.
OL,12,FThe Home Office intends to turn Roman
OL,13,FCourt, a former sheltered housing
OL,14,Fcomplex in Leverington, near Wisbech,
OL,15,Finto a 26-bed unit for women and
OL,16,Fchildren.
OL,18,FThe proposal sparked a large protest
OL,19,Fand a fire at the building a week later
OL,20,Fwas being treated as arson.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
