OL,3,GNEWSA'Alarm' as asylum seeker unit
OL,4,Aconfirmed for village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said concerns raised by
OL,7,FFenland District Council had been taken
OL,8,Finto account, but the Conservative-run
OL,9,Fcouncil said it was "alarmed" the plans
OL,10,Fwere going ahead.
